{"case_id":"T8007","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["input semantics","state","attack surface"],"commit_induced":"YES","maintenance_needed":true,"confidence":97,"affected_functions":["archive_read_format_rar_read_data","read_data_compressed","parse_codes","ppmd_read","PpmdRAR_RangeDec_Init","Ppmd7_DecodeSymbol","Ppmd7_Alloc","Ppmd7_Init"],"reason":"S1 adds a substantial PPMd Variant H decoding path for RAR methods COMPRESS_METHOD_GOOD and COMPRESS_METHOD_BEST, including allocator/model state and range-decoder logic. H0 reaches the general RAR reader through archive_read_support_format_all and archive_read_data_block, but its fixed RAR inputs are named as uncompressed, normal-compressed, multi-LZSS, subblock, Unicode, or truncated archives; none identifies a PPMd archive. Sparse mutation of fewer than 1% of those existing images does not provide adequate structured control over the coordinated compression method, PPMd block flag, ppmd_flags, dictionary size, maxorder, range-decoder bytes, and encoded symbol stream needed to exercise the new decoder beyond shallow rejection or initialization. This material coverage gap did not exist in S0 because the PPMd implementation and the GOOD/BEST dispatch were introduced by S1.","evidence":["archive_read_format_rar_read_data newly routes COMPRESS_METHOD_GOOD and COMPRESS_METHOD_BEST to read_data_compressed; S0 reported those methods as unsupported.","parse_codes changes the PPMd block-bit branch from an unsupported-format failure into initialization driven by ppmd_flags, dictionary_size, InitEsc, and maxorder.","S1 adds CPpmd7 and CPpmd7z_RangeDec state to struct rar and invokes Ppmd7_DecodeSymbol when rar->is_ppmd_block is set.","The new files archive_ppmd7.c and archive_ppmd7dec.c add model allocation/update and range-decoding attack surface, including Ppmd7_Alloc, Ppmd7_Init, Ppmd7_Update1, Ppmd7_Update2, and Ppmd7_DecodeSymbol.","H0 calls archive_read_support_format_all and drains archive_read_data_block, so the public API protocol is suitable, but its files[] list contains no PPMd-designated RAR seed.","H0 only corrupts numbytes selected below size/100 in existing images, which does not adequately control the multiple correlated RAR and PPMd fields introduced in parse_codes."],"recommended_action":"Add at least one valid RAR input using COMPRESS_METHOD_GOOD or COMPRESS_METHOD_BEST with a PPMd block, and preferably corpus variants controlling ppmd_flags, dictionary_size, InitEsc, maxorder, truncation, and repeated-block decoder state; retain the existing archive_read_open_memory and archive_read_data_block protocol."}
